The Bakery

This product includes markup, styles and icons adapted from Coolify v4.3.23
(https://github.com/coollabsio/coolify), Copyright 2025 Andras Bacsai
(coolLabs Technologies), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The adapted files have been
rewritten for Svelte and Tailwind CSS and changed throughout; Coolify's name,
logo and brand are not used.

The guild, agent and work model (Guilds, Memberships, Agents, Goals, Issues
and the rest) follows Paperclip (https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip),
Copyright (c) 2025 Paperclip AI, licensed under the MIT License. The
dashboard's look is adapted from Paperclip's user interface (its design
tokens in ui/src/index.css, its components in ui/src/components and its
page layouts in ui/src/pages), rewritten for Svelte and Tailwind CSS; Paperclip's name and logo are not used.
The Projects, Project, Environment, New Resource and their settings pages
port ui/src/components/CollectionToolbar.tsx, EntityRow.tsx, ProjectTile.tsx,
EmptyState.tsx and PageSkeleton.tsx (as apps/web/src/lib/CollectionToolbar,
EntityRow, ProjectTile, PageSkeleton and lib/ui/Empty), and the layouts of
ui/src/pages/Projects.tsx and ProjectDetail.tsx.
The Application, Database and Service pages port
ui/src/components/SidebarSection.tsx, SidebarNavItem.tsx and PageTabBar.tsx
(as apps/web/src/lib/ResourceNav), ui/src/lib/status-colors.ts (as
apps/web/src/lib/statusColors.ts), the Filter popover of ui/src/pages/Issues.tsx
(as apps/web/src/lib/FilterPopover), the run log of
ui/src/components/transcript/RunTranscriptView.tsx (as the Deployment and
Runtime Logs viewer and apps/web/src/pages/application/LogButton), and the
detail layouts of ui/src/pages/ProjectDetail.tsx and AgentDetail.tsx.
The settings pages (Notifications, Keys & Tokens, Profile and Settings) port
the frame of ui/src/pages/CompanySettings.tsx and CompanyAccess.tsx (as
apps/web/src/lib/settings/SettingsPage and SettingsGroup) and the layout of
ui/src/pages/ProfileSettings.tsx (as apps/web/src/pages/Profile).
The Desktop app's Runner recognises a Subscription limit with the patterns
and the reset-time reading of
packages/adapters/claude-local/src/server/parse.ts (CLAUDE_PROVIDER_QUOTA_RE,
CLAUDE_EXTRA_USAGE_RESET_RE and parseClaudeResetClockTime), ported to Go in
apps/desktop/runner/transcript.go.

The dashboard's components are built with shadcn-svelte
(https://github.com/huntabyte/shadcn-svelte) on bits-ui
(https://github.com/huntabyte/bits-ui), both licensed under the MIT License.

The dashboard uses Lucide icons (https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide),
Copyright (c) Lucide Contributors, licensed under the ISC License.

Descriptions and Comments are rendered from Markdown with marked
(https://github.com/markedjs/marked), licensed under the MIT License, and
sanitized with DOMPurify (https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify), licensed
under the Apache License 2.0 (or MPL 2.0).

